ls of Asia 4K -    • Wildlife of Asia 4K - Scenic Animal Film W...  \n\nBig Cats 4K -    • Big Cats Of The World 4K - Scenic Wildlife...  \n\nMonkeys 4K -    • Monkeys \u0026 Primates 4K - Scenic Wildlife Fi...  \n\nAustralia's Animals 4K -    • Animals of Australia 4K - Scenic Wildlife ...  \n\nThe Amazon 4K -    • The Amazon 4K - Scenic Wildlife Film With ...  \n\nBirds of the World 4K -    • Birds Of The World 4K - Scenic Wildlife Fi...  \n\nFollow us on instagram @scenicrelaxationfilms\n\nWhere we get our music - https://fm.pxf.io/scenicfreetrial\nGreat Place for Stock footage - https://bit.ly/3GptQHd\nGreat Place for Assets - https://bit.ly/3K59ZPK\n\nTimestamps:\n\n0:00 - Animals of the Ocean\n11:05 - Whales\n13:57 - Sharks\n17:16 - Dolphins\n20:44 - Seals \u0026 Sea Lions\n23:37 - Sea Turtles\n25:57 - Schools of Fish\n30:26 - Coral Reefs\n34:02 - Dugongs \u0026 Manatees\n36:05 - Rays \u0026 Mobulas\n39:30 - Peculiar Creatures of the Sea\n42:29 - Ocean World\n57:39 - Outro\n\nThanks for watching :)","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":365,"length":52,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPMEEM2rARgBIhMIoJ2pnPr8lAMVz99VCR3kJww1ygEE7Qz5Dw==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/watch?v=55xU9focn9M","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_WATCH","rootVe":3832}},"watchEndpoint":{"videoId":"55xU9focn9M","startTimeSeconds":0,"watchEndpointSupportedOnesieConfig":{"html5PlaybackOnesieConfig":{"commonConfig":{"url":"https://rr6---sn-gwpa-itqer.googlevideo.com/initplayback?source=youtube\u0026oeis=1\u0026c=WEB\u0026oad=3200\u0026ovd=3200\u0026oaad=11000\u0026oavd=11000\u0026ocs=700\u0026oewis=1\u0026oputc=1\u0026ofpcc=1\u0026siu=1\u0026msp=1\u0026odepv=1\u0026id=e79c54f5fa1c9fd3\u0026ip=2409%3A408c%3A1d18%3Abf15%3Af401%3Ae0a1%3A8f6%3A33d7\u0026initcwndbps=873750\u0026mt=1781103196\u0026oweuc="}}}}}},"onTapOptions":{"accessibilityInfo":{"accessibilityLabel":"YouTube Channel Link: Earth's Animals - Scenic Wildlife Film with Inspiring Music"}}},{"startIndex":438,"